        "tags": [
          "Balances"
        ],
        "summary": "List balances — an integrator holding a read grant sends X-Grant-Id + X-Grant-Secret to list the approving user's balances instead of its own, receiving the narrower grantee projection; parent_balance_id is refused (400) on a granted read, because that projection withholds tree structure",
